OL,3,ASkye Newman gets 'goosebumps' over
OL,4,Arecord-breaking Brixton Academy run
OL,5,
OL,6,FFast rising pop star Skye Newman began
OL,7,Fher November five-gig run at Brixton
OL,8,FAcademy on Thursday - a record for a
OL,9,FBritish female solo artist
OL,11,FThe BBC Sound of 2026 winner is set to
OL,12,Fovertake rapper Little Simz, who
OL,13,Fheadlined three nights at the legendary
OL,14,Fsouth London venue in 2021.
OL,16,FIt will cap an incredible few years for
OL,17,FBrit Award nominee Newman, 23, who
OL,18,Fperformed at Radio 1's Big Weekend in
OL,19,FSunderland last month.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
