OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,8,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,9,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,10,     Ffavourites.
OL,11,G1300 Classical Live
OL,12,     FElizabeth Alker brings you
OL,13,     Fexclusive live performances,
OL,14,     Fincluding Schumann's Piano
OL,15,     FConcerto and Mendelssohn's A
OL,16,     FMidsummer Night's Dream.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Rameau
OL,18,     F5/5. Donald Macleod traces
OL,19,     FRameau's final years, including
OL,20,     Fthe reception to his final stage
OL,21,     Fwork and his pursuit of a pay
OL,22,     Frise.
